[
  {
    "content_id": "10063001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作长老的写信给蒙拣选的太太和她的儿女，就是我诚心所爱的；不但我爱，也是一切知道真理之人所爱的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;爱你们是为真理的缘故，这真理存在我们里面，也必永远与我们同在。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;恩惠、怜悯、平安从父　神和他儿子耶稣基督在真理和爱心上必常与我们同在！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我见你的儿女，有照我们从父所受之命令遵行真理的，就甚欢喜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;太太啊，我现在劝你，我们大家要彼此相爱。这并不是我写一条新命令给你，乃是我们从起初所受的命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我们若照他的命令行，这就是爱。你们从起初所听见当行的，就是这命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为世上有许多迷惑人的出来，他们不认耶稣基督是成了肉身来的；这就是那迷惑人、敌基督的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们要小心，不要失去你们所做的工，乃要得着满足的赏赐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;凡越过基督的教训不常守着的，就没有　神；常守这教训的，就有父又有子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;若有人到你们那里，不是传这教训，不要接他到家里，也不要问他的安；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为问他安的，就在他的恶行上有分。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我还有许多事要写给你们，却不愿意用纸墨写出来，但盼望到你们那里，与你们当面谈论，使你们的喜乐满足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰二书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你那蒙拣选之姊妹的儿女都问你安。</p>"
  }
]